2026-09-23T17:10:31.7282086Z         ================================== FAILURES ===================================
2026-09-23T17:10:31.7282498Z         _________________________________ test_answer _________________________________
2026-09-23T17:10:31.7282840Z     
2026-09-23T17:10:31.7283050Z             def test_answer():
2026-09-23T17:10:31.7283303Z         >       assert inc(3) == 5
2026-09-23T17:10:31.7283576Z         E       assert 4 == 5
2026-09-23T17:10:31.7283950Z         E        +  where 4 = inc(3)
